Variant type: noninteractive

Additional constraints:
- Derived from `write-spec`: reuses its spec structure, section order, prose rules,
  open-questions format, alternatives conventions, and readiness criteria 1–6
  (criterion 7 is always deferred).
- No interactive loop: no phase gates; the full pass runs without pausing.
- All mid-pass questions are batched into a `## Questions for you` block at the end.
- Conflicting or ambiguous design signals surface in the deferred questions,
  never resolved silently.
- Path model simplified to `<slug>/SPEC.md` (no `$basedir`/`$specdir`/`$specpath`).
- Spec lifecycle is `DRAFT` only; `READY`/`ABANDONED` are set manually by the user
  (promotion/rename script dropped; `MAYBE-READY` unused).
- Supports Create and Update modes.
- Keeps `refs/` — progressive disclosure retained, not a standalone export.